# 微信/QQ 内置浏览器缓存很顽固，给核心资源加"不缓存/每次校验"，确保每次都能拿到最新版
/js/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/css/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# 游戏安装包：点链接直接下载（不打开网页）
/downloads/*.zip
  Content-Type: application/zip
  Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="milkfrog-game.zip"
